  {"type": "split", "reverse": True, "h2": "Goodman furnace and AC repair, maintenance and service", "image": "Licensed technician checking heat pump refrigerant pressures with digital gauges", "image_src": "/assets/img/work/heat-pump-commissioning-gauges.webp", "image_fit": "cover", "image_credit": "EHI install", "html": "<p>Already own a Goodman furnace or air conditioner? We repair and maintain Goodman equipment of any age, whoever installed it. Our TSSA-certified gas technicians handle no-heat calls, ignitor and flame sensor faults, pressure switch and inducer problems, blower motor failures and control board error codes.</p><p>On the cooling side, our licensed refrigeration techs fix Goodman ACs and heat pumps that won't cool, freeze up, leak refrigerant, short cycle or make noise. Every repair starts with a diagnosis and a written quote before any work.</p><p>Yearly maintenance keeps a Goodman system efficient and catches small problems before they turn into a January breakdown. Book through our <a href='/furnace/repair-maintenance/'>furnace repair and maintenance</a> or <a href='/ac/repair-maintenance/'>AC repair and maintenance</a> pages, or call for <a href='/services/emergency-hvac/'>emergency HVAC service</a> if you have no heat or no cooling.</p>"},
